3. The Bank covenants with the director that:
(i) the Bank shall apprise the director about:
(a) Board procedures including identification of legal and other duties of
Director and required compliances with statutory obligations;
(b) control systems and procedures;
(c) voting rights at Board meetings including matters in which Director
should not participate because of his/her interest, direct or indirect
therein;
(d) qualification requirements and provide copies of Memorandum and
Articles of Association;
(e) corporate policies and procedures;
